'''Gremlins''' are encountered as normal [[Monsters|Enemies]] in [[Act 1]]. In [[Act 2]], Gremlins appear only as {{KW|Minion|Minions}} in the {{M|Gremlin Leader|Gremlin Leader's}} [[Elite]] encounter.
{{TOC limit|2}}

== Fat Gremlin ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Fat Gremlin}}
'''Fat Gremlins''' focus on applying {{KW|Weak}}.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Fat Gremlin}}
'''Fat Gremlin''' uses {{Int|Fat Gremlin|Smash}} every turn.
{{Clear}}

== Mad Gremlin ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Mad Gremlin}} {{Power Infobox|Angry}}
'''Mad Gremlins''' will do more damage as they are attacked.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Mad Gremlin}}
'''Mad Gremlin''' uses {{Int|Mad Gremlin|Scratch}} every turn.
{{Clear}}

== Shield Gremlin ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Shield Gremlin}}
'''Shield Gremlins''' focus on giving {{KW|Block}} to their allies.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Shield Gremlin}}
'''Shield Gremlin''' uses {{Int|Shield Gremlin|Protect}} every turn. If it is the only enemy left, it will switch to using {{Int|Shield Gremlin|Shield Bash}} every turn.
{{Clear}}

== Sneaky Gremlin ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Sneaky Gremlin}}
'''Sneaky Gremlins''' focus on doing consistent damage each turn.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Sneaky Gremlin}}
'''Sneaky Gremlin''' uses {{Int|Sneaky Gremlin|Puncture}} every turn.
{{Clear}}

== Gremlin Wizard ==
{{Enemy Infobox|Gremlin Wizard}}
'''Gremlin Wizards''' charge up before unleashing a powerful attack.

=== Pattern ===
{{Intents|Gremlin Wizard}}
'''Gremlin Wizard''' will always start by using {{Int|Gremlin Wizard|Charging}} twice in a row, then using {{Int|Gremlin Wizard|Ultimate Blast}}. After that and for the rest of combat, '''Gremlin Wizard''' will use {{Int|Gremlin Wizard|Charging}} three times in a row before using {{Int|Gremlin Wizard|Ultimate Blast}}.

On {{Asc|17|Ascension}}, '''Gremlin Wizard''' will use {{Int|Gremlin Wizard|Charging}} twice in a row, then use {{Int|Gremlin Wizard|Ultimate Blast}} every turn for the rest of combat.
{{Clear}}

== In Party With ==
=== Act 1 ===
In the '''Gremlin Gang''' encounter, randomly choosing from the following list for a total of 4 enemies:
* 2 {{M|Fat Gremlin|Fat Gremlins}}
* 2 {{M|Sneaky Gremlin|Sneaky Gremlins}}
* 2 {{M|Mad Gremlin|Mad Gremlins}}
* 1 {{M|Shield Gremlin}}
* 1 {{M|Gremlin Wizard}}

=== Act 2 ===
As {{KW|Minion|Minions}} in an Elite encounter consisting of:
* 2 random '''Gremlins'''
* 1 {{M|Gremlin Leader}}

= Tips =
* Gremlins summoned by {{M|Gremlin Leader}} will always have the {{KW|Minion}} [[Buff]], so the effects of {{KW|Fatal}} will not work on them.

= Trivia =
* The {{E|Wheel of Change}} and {{E|Match and Keep}} [[Events]] are run by Gremlins.
* {{R|Gremlin Visage}} is a reference to Gremlins, although it doesn't resemble any of the types seen in the game.
** {{R|Gremlin Horn}} also references Gremlins, specifically {{M|Gremlin Nob}}.
* Mad Gremlin appears in the artwork of {{C|Riddle with Holes}} and {{C|Trip}}.
* An unidentified Gremlin appears in the artwork of {{C|Cleave}}, {{C|Hemokinesis}}, {{C|Reckless Charge}}, {{C|Sever Soul}}, {{C|Eviscerate}}, {{C|Noxious Fumes}}, {{C|Rip and Tear}}, {{C|Bowling Bash}} and {{C|Expunger}}.

